{
  "name": "PhotoTransferPacket",
  "kind": "packet",
  "id": 99,
  "description": "\n\tWhen the player uses the camera item or adds a photo to the scrapbook it sends the photo to the server,\n\tthen the server sends a response back on whether that was successful or not.\n\tEither uploads a photo to the server's photoStorage or request one from it to be stored in client's photoStorage.\n\tIf no mPhotoData is provided it is a request for the given filename.\n\t",
